<Base title="Services" current="services" description="Incident management, operational readiness, cloud cost optimisation, observability and bespoke applications.">
  <h1>Services</h1>
  <p>Five areas, one approach: fix what's hurting you first, measure the result, and leave the team able to keep it working.</p>

  <h2><a href="/services/incident-management/">Incident management</a></h2>
  <p>Clear response processes, roles and post-incident reviews that turn outages into lasting fixes. Includes process design, on-call setup and coaching for responders.</p>

  <h2><a href="/services/operational-readiness/">Operational readiness</a></h2>
  <p>Checking that a service is ready for production before launch: runbooks, monitoring, failover, support handover and risk review.</p>

  <h2><a href="/services/cloud-cost-optimisation/">Cloud cost optimisation</a></h2>
  <p>Finding where cloud spend goes, removing waste, and setting up the controls to keep it down. Practical changes first, with the savings measured.</p>

  <h2><a href="/services/observability/">Observability</a></h2>
  <p>Logs, metrics and traces you can act on. Dashboards and alerts tied to what matters to the business, with noise cut down.</p>

  <h2><a href="/services/bespoke-applications/">Bespoke applications</a></h2>
  <p>Custom tools for operations and personal workflows, built to be maintained by the people who use them.</p>

  <p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a></p>
</Base>
